Z||000000||Nashco||11-24-2001||11:30 PM||||Hey all!<P>Lately I've been on a big kick for Ben Folds.  I like his latest music a lot, and I always liked Ben Folds Five a little.  Well, he was on Conan the other night, and I decided it'd be cool to see him in concert.<P>I checked out his website to see if he was on tour or anything and found out he's in Birmingham THIS WEDNESDAY!  I hadn't heard a thing, and I'd really like to see him.  Tickets are only 20 bucks, so I'm really thinking about going.<P>So, does anybody else like Ben Folds?  Anybody seen him in concert?  Anybody from around here interested in going?<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
